                <pb facs="1130" n="1034" sameAs="frus:frus1879/pg1034"/>

                <head>No. 487.<lb/><hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Van
                            Dyck to Mr. Hunter.</hi></head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Cairo</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1879-10-17"><hi rendition="#italic">October</hi> 17, 1879</date>.
                        (Received November 12.)</dateline></opener>
                <p><hi rendition="#small-caps">Sir</hi>: The accompanying statements concerning the
                    Suez Canal are short but comprehensive, and may be of use to the department.</p>
                <p>I have, &amp;c.,</p>
                <closer><signed>EDWARD A. VAN DYCK.</signed></closer>



